# The [HW] button: one press disconnects everything, the next connects it
# all again. On the emulated devices.
name    HW button: off and on again
timeout 180

expect 30  [SCENARIO] HW
wait   4
press  HW OFF
expect 15  [BUTTON] HW OFF -> HW OFF
shot   off
wait   2
press  HW OFF
expect 30  [HW] Camera:
expect 30  [BUTTON] HW OFF -> HW 3/3
